        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "THE SITUATION"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A flight training school in Ireland that sold discovery flights as the first step to a pilot licence, and lost most of the people who enquired."
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "A pilot licence is a long, expensive decision. Enquiries came in, got one email, and went quiet. Ads were judged on enquiries, not on who went on to train."
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT WE CHANGED"
        },
        {
          "type": "ol",
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "Google Ads on 'learn to fly' and 'pilot licence' searches, landing on a discovery flight page",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Meta campaigns with cockpit video that stopped the scroll",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "A nine-email sequence over six weeks covering cost, time, medicals and what the first lesson is like",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Tracking from first click to booked discovery flight to enrolled student",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            },
            {
              "text": "Monthly open evenings promoted to the whole email list",
              "href": null,
              "imgs": []
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "h2",
          "text": "WHAT HAPPENED"
        },
        {
          "type": "p",
          "text": "Discovery flight bookings rose 3.4x, cost per lead fell 38% and the school enrolled a record number of new students in the following intake."
        }
      ]
    },
